      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Earth Tones: Olive Green, Brown, and Rust. These bring a rugged, stylish edge to your look. Pair an olive pant with a simple white tee, and you're immediately the best-dressed guy in the room.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
