      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Summer Brights: White, Beige, and Light Grey. These are your go-to shades for hot days. They reflect the sun and look incredible paired with our [Men's Linen Shirts](https://cottonworld.net/search?type=product&q=mens+linen+shirts).",
