      "text": "Take a pair of our sharp navy chinos and pair them with a tucked-in [Men's Polos](https://cottonworld.net/search?type=product&q=mens+polo). Add a brown leather belt and some classic loafers. It's comfortable enough for a nine-hour shift but looks entirely professional.",
