      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "1. Are cotton pants suitable for formal office wear?",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00074",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[74]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 5026,
      "endIndex": 5250,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Yes, absolutely. Our tailored chinos and structured cotton pants offer a clean, professional silhouette. Stick to classic colors like Navy, Black, or Khaki, and pair them with a tucked-in button-down shirt and formal shoes.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00075",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[75]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 5250,
      "endIndex": 5251,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00076",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[76]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 5251,
      "endIndex": 5285,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "2. Do linen pants wrinkle easily?",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00077",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[77]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 5285,
      "endIndex": 5526,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Linen naturally has a bit of texture and will form soft wrinkles as you move. That's actually the beauty of the fabric! It gives off a relaxed, premium look. If you want a sharper finish for an event, a quick steam does the trick perfectly.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00078",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[78]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 5526,
      "endIndex": 5527,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
